# Keep text files LF in the repository, whatever the checkout platform.
#
# The sources are run by Node and DSH on Windows, macOS and Linux; a CRLF round-trip
# would otherwise show up as a whole-file diff on every commit. The helper's generated
# output is compared byte-for-byte against its source by tools/check-sync.mjs, so
# stable line endings are not cosmetic here.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
